# DocLintFleet suppressions for historical release labels, explicit API-stability docs,
# and threat-model closure logs. Each suppression keeps a reason; do not add blanket
# maturity-language suppressions for new docs.

STATUS.md:v1.0:honest posture section names legacy git tags while downgrading semver claim
STATUS.md:v1.3:status evidence references released closure versions
STATUS.md:v1.x:honest posture section names legacy tag pattern while downgrading semver claim
STATUS.md:stable:honest posture section discusses what evidence is still missing
STATUS.md:production-grade:honest posture section explicitly rejects production-grade claim

CHANGELOG.md:v1.0:changelog preserves historical release labels
CHANGELOG.md:v1.3:changelog preserves historical release labels
CHANGELOG.md:v1.4:changelog preserves historical release labels
CHANGELOG.md:v1.x:changelog preserves historical release labels
CHANGELOG.md:stable:changelog records compatibility intent as historical release note
CHANGELOG.md:Production-grade:changelog preserves historical release heading for audit continuity

README.md:v1.0:readme names legacy tags while pointing to pre-1.0 posture
.canonical-readme.md:v1.0:canonical readme names legacy tags while downgrading semver claim
.canonical-readme.md:v1.3:canonical readme records release-evidence versions
.canonical-readme.md:v1.x:canonical readme names legacy tag pattern while downgrading semver claim
.canonical-readme.md:stable:canonical readme discusses missing Zig stability evidence
.canonical-readme.md:production-grade:canonical readme explicitly gates production-grade claim

